{"id":"invention","lemma":"invention","pos":"noun","rank":3824,"glosses":["invention"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.vɑ̃.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/21/Fr-invention.ogg/Fr-invention.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"inventions"},"formAudio":{"inventions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-inventions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons une bonne opinion de votre invention.","en":"We have a good opinion of your invention.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"opinion"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Quelle invention merveilleuse !","en":"What a wonderful invention!","words":[{"g":"which?"},null,{"g":"marvelous, brilliant","l":"merveilleux"}]},{"text":"Cette invention te rendra très riche.","en":"This invention will make you very rich.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to return","l":"rendre"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"rich"}]},{"text":"La nécessité est mère de l'invention.","en":"Necessity is the mother of invention.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"necessity"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"La machine à laver est une invention merveilleuse.","en":"The washing machine is a wonderful invention.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"marvelous, brilliant","l":"merveilleux"}],"phrases":[[1,4,"washing machine"]]}]}